#compdef users

# `users [FILE]`: print the logged-in user names from utmp, or from FILE
# (builtin_users in src/extensions/ext_builtins.rs). Named _zshrs_users so
# it does not shadow zsh's own _users (the user-name type function).
#
# zshrs builtin. Bundled into ~/.zshrs/functions by build.rs.

_arguments '1:utmp file:_files'
